<html>
  <head>
    <title>Twopart - A norwegian cardgame (in two parts)</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Documentation of the Twopart cardgame">
    <meta name="keywords" content="Documentation, Docu, Twopart; game, card, cardgame">

    <meta name="DC.Creator" content="Markus Schwab">
